From: Sanju Abraham <s.abraham@f5.com>
Date: Fri, 29 May 2026 09:27:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] test(governance): cover VK ID secondary index + header
 parser

Adds plugins/governance/vk_id_header_test.go (21 tests) for
patch2/vk-id-header's governance plugin paths:

- GetVirtualKeyByID against the virtualKeysByID secondary index,
  covering not-found, found, multi-key, CreateInMemory, DeleteInMemory,
  UpdateInMemory (all keep the secondary index in sync with the primary)
- VKIDHeader constant pinned to the wire-protocol value
- ParseVirtualKeyFromFastHTTPRequest header precedence:
  X-Bifrost-VK-ID > x-bf-vk > Authorization: Bearer > x-api-key >
  x-goog-api-key
- Non-VK-prefix tokens are ignored across all value-based headers
- ID resolution path doesn't leak through value-based lookup paths
---
